  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): decouple platform runtime infrastructure and clean up attributes\n\n      BREAKING CHANGE: Move platform-facing runtime constructs, manager lifecycle hooks, and app attributes to LuciferCore.Platforms to keep Core as a pure low-level engine.\n\n      - Extracted routing, manager, and middleware runtime infrastructure to LuciferCore.Platforms.\n      - Split legacy `UltityAttribute` bundle into individual dedicated attribute files (`Bootstrap`, `Config`, `ConsoleCommand`, `LogTag`, `Plugin`, `Service`) and migrated application-level attributes to Platforms.\n      - Removed legacy bundled attribute files to eliminate meta-programming bloat from Core.\n      - Refactored logging calls to route cleanly through `LogManager` via typed helpers (`Info`, `Warn`, `Error`, `Debug`, `Fatal`) with `LogLevel.INFO` ANSI color support.\n      - Stripped server ordering and coordination state from `ServerTransport` (lifecycle coordination is now centralized under Platforms.Core.Platforms).\n      - Cleaned up assembly dependencies and prepared Core for the next preview release.",
